| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `renderError` | `JsxParserProps[` | - | Custom error renderer passed to react-jsx-parser. |
| `...props` | `React.ComponentProps<` | - | Any other props are spread to the underlying div element. |

### `<JSXPreviewError />`

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
